	 *
	 * Range rules are normalized according to `type`:
	 * - `'integer' | 'number'`: `min`/`max` accept `number`
	 * - `'date' | 'datetime'`: `min`/`max` accept `string`
	 * - all other field types ignore `min`/`max`
